Thank you, <%= @donor.display_name %>.

We received your <%= @donation.recurring? ? "monthly partnership" : "gift" %> of
<%= @donation.amount_formatted %> toward the <%= @donation.designation_label %> on
<%= @donation.donated_at&.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>.

No campaign noise — just gratitude, and a promise to put it to work the same week
it lands.

— For your records —
Date:        <%= @donation.donated_at&.strftime("%b %-d, %Y") %>
Amount:      <%= @donation.amount_formatted %>
Designation: <%= @donation.designation_label %>
Frequency:   <%= @donation.recurring? ? "Monthly" : "One time" %>
<% if @donation.stripe_payment_intent_id.present? %>Reference:   <%= @donation.stripe_payment_intent_id %><% end %>

IMPACT Ministry, Inc. — Mississippi. 501(c)(3) status pending; this receipt is
provisional until the IRS determination letter is issued.
